BT /F1 12 Tf 72 704 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 688 Td (1. Consistency guarantees) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 672 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 656 Td (Replicas of the same data can briefly disagree while writes travel between them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 640 Td (Eventual consistency only promises that replicas converge once writes stop.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 624 Td (Stronger guarantees are easier to reason about, but need more coordination.) Tj ET
