BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td (2. Linearizability) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 704 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 688 Td (A linearizable system behaves as if there were a single copy of the data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 672 Td (Once any read has returned a new value, every later read returns it too.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 656 Td (It is a recency guarantee, and it costs latency when the network is slow.) Tj ET
endstream
