BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td (3. Ordering and causality) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 704 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 688 Td (Causal order keeps every cause before its effect, and is cheaper than a total order.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 672 Td (Total order broadcast delivers every message to every node in the same order.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 656 Td (With total order broadcast, replicas can apply the same writes in the same order.) Tj ET
endstream
