BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td (4. Consensus) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 704 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 688 Td (Consensus gets nodes to agree on one value, even when some of them crash.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 672 Td (A majority quorum means any two decisions share at least one node.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 656 Td (Raft elects one leader per term, and the leader asks a quorum before it commits.) Tj ET
